  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. One 4:3 landscape illustration, 1536x1152 or closest native supported 4:3. Refined Indian watercolor with restrained gouache on warm ivory, quiet ochre, sage, dusty terracotta and muted indigo, warm lamplight. The Burnt Book lesson calling.eight: a procession returning through a lamplit village lane, school gate ahead. FOUR DISTINCT HUMAN FIGURES, all clearly visible: (1) elderly Acarya with white beard in saffron carries a brass lamp; (2) a rescued small pupil wrapped warmly in grandmother's grey shawl, walking beside the Acarya; (3) grandmother Dadi in cream cotton sari with thin maroon border, silver hair in low bun, round spectacles; (4) the learner seen from behind in an ochre kurta with cloth shoulder bag. A green rose-ringed parrot with red beak perches on the learner. A faint blue-grey echo spirit with ear-like curls walks quietly alongside. The rescued pupil must be a separate child, not merged with the learner; the four humans and spirit form a compact central grouping. Complete figures comfortably within canvas. Gentle relief and homecoming. This scene needs no writing. No fake script, watermark, UI or border.",
